{"titulo": "✅ Errores estructurados", "demo": "2.2", "dominio": 2, "simulada": false, "fecha": "2026-11-23 12:53", "ajustes": {"D22_FORMATO": "estructurado", "DETALLE": "basico"}, "lineas": ["🎛  Panel settings for this run: D22_FORMATO = \"estructurado\"", "\u001b[2m   Model: claude-haiku-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m\u001b[2m-\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m5\u001b[0m", "\u001b[2m   HTML mode: on → salidas_html/dominio2/\u001b[0m", "", "\u001b[34m───────────────── \u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m DEMO \u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m2.2\u001b[0m\u001b[1;37;48;5;18m · Structured errors: so Claude knows WHAT failed and WHAT to do \u001b[0m\u001b[34m ─────────────────\u001b[0m", "", "\u001b[2m📖 This demo's guide: python lab_dominio2.py guia \u001b[0m\u001b[1;2;36m2.2\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  ·  more detail: set DETALLE = \u001b[0m\u001b[2;32m\"completo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[2m at the top of \u001b[0m", "\u001b[2mthe file\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m 💡 Exam concept \u001b[0m\u001b[33m─────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                            \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  A generic error ('Operation failed') doesn't tell Claude whether to retry, ask for other data or          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  escalate. Worse: returning an empty list when the system failed makes Claude say something FALSE ('you    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  have no orders').                                                                                         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  Structured error = is_error: true + errorCategory (transient / validation / business / permission) +      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  isRetryable + a readable description. And a valid empty result is NOT an error.                           \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  In MCP the field is called isError in the tool's result; in the Messages API it's is_error in the         \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m  tool_result block. Same idea.                                                                             \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                            \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[33m───────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m The tool we'll use \u001b[0m\u001b[33m───────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[33m─╮\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m                                                                                                          \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"buscar_pedidos_cliente\"\u001b[0m,                                                                        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"description\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"Devuelve los pedidos de un cliente a partir de su email. Opcionalmente filtra por año. \u001b[0m  \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32mSi la tool devuelve un error, lee errorCategory e isRetryable para decidir qué hacer.\"\u001b[0m,                    \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;34m\"input_schema\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m                                                                                        \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m     \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"object\"\u001b[0m,                                                                                      \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m", "\u001b[33m│\u001b[0m     \u001b[1;34m